{"text":"To share this application on WhatsApp, you'll need to deploy it first since it's currently running locally. Here are your options:

## Quick Options to Deploy & Share:

### 1. **Deploy to Vercel (Recommended - Easiest)**","textMode":"visible_message"}

{"text":"Here's what changed:

- **Features** — removed "Earn verified certificates" and "Peer & mentor support", replaced with 🧠 Practice tests & mock exams and 📈 Track your progress daily
- **Rotating quotes** — 7 motivational quotes now cycle every 4.5 seconds with a smooth fade-up in / fade-up out transition. A white progress bar at the bottom of the quote card visually counts down to the next quote, so users always know when it's changing","textMode":"visible_message"}
